{"ref":"weapon:familiar-forge","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Familiar Forge is a weapon selector from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. It allows the player to select one of the Ode to Castlevania familiars. It is the starting weapon of ",{"i":"Sprite-Young_Maria_Renard.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:young-maria-renard"}," ",{"t":"Young Maria Renard","r":"character:young-maria-renard"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Weapon","rows":[{"label":"ID","hint":"Weapon's name in game files.","cells":[["TP_FAMILIARFORGE"]]},{"label":"Type","cells":[["Normal"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["1"]]},{"label":"Rarity","hint":"Weapon's weight in the pool of available weapons.","cells":[["6"]]}]},{"title":"Stats","rows":[{"label":"Damage","hint":"Damage number randomization in ±5 range is only a visual effect. Actual damage dealt is always the same.","cells":[["-"],[]]},{"label":"Area","cells":[["-"],[]]},{"label":"Speed","hint":"Weapon's projectile speed.","cells":[["-"],[]]},{"label":"Amount","hint":"Amount of projectiles/areas fired per use.","cells":[["-"],[]]},{"label":"Pierce","hint":"Maximum amount of enemies that a projectile can hit.","cells":[["Area of Effect"],[]]},{"label":"Projectile Interval","cells":[["0 s"],[]]},{"label":"Knockback","cells":[["-"],[]]},{"label":"Blocked by walls","cells":[["No"],[]]}],"cols":["Normal","Max"]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Familiar Forge opens a list of Familiars (Familiar or Innocent Devil) to pick. Once picked, they will be summoned as secondary character, having their own weapons, sharing passive effects of the character, and acts independently depending on behavior. Familiars won't be removed from the list when selected, allowing multiples of the same familiar to be chosen."]},{"k":"p","c":["Additionally, when a Familiar is obtained Ode to Castlevania pickups for the character are enabled and can be obtained from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Once ",{"i":"Sprite-Black_Disk.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:black-disk"}," ",{"t":"Black Disk","r":"relic:black-disk"}," is obtained, the Familiar Forge will occur in Ode To Castlevania stage, in the aqueduct biome. It is unlocked by picking it up."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, the Familiar Forge can be unlocked by playing ",{"i":"Sprite-Hector.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:hector"}," ",{"t":"Hector","r":"character:hector"}," and selecting it as his guaranteed 4th level up option offered every 7 levels so long as valid weapon or passive weapon level up choices remain."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"list-of-familiars","title":"List of Familiars","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Icon"],"h":1},{"c":["Familiar"],"h":1},{"c":["Weapon"],"h":1},{"c":["Behavior"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Icon-Ukoback.png","w":32,"h":32}]},{"c":["Ukoback"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Svarog_Statue.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"weapon:svarog-statue"}," ",{"t":"Svarog Statue","r":"weapon:svarog-statue"}," (level 3)"]},{"c":["Runs toward and distract enemies."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Icon-Bitterfly.png","w":32,"h":32}]},{"c":["Bitterfly"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Garlic.png","w":17,"h":17,"r":"weapon:garlic"}," ",{"t":"Garlic","r":"weapon:garlic"}," (level 7)"]},{"c":["Stays close to the character."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Icon-Alleged_Ghost.png","w":32,"h":32}]},{"c":["Alleged Ghost"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Summon_Spirit.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:summon-spirit"}," ",{"t":"Summon Spirit","r":"weapon:summon-spirit"}," (level 7)"]},{"c":["Moves opposite to the character's movement and distract enemies."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Icon-Imp.png","w":32,"h":32}]},{"c":["Imp"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Trident.png","w":24,"h":2